  ('zcrm_1579374000004207005', 'Wendy Scipione', 'Cancelled', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Member Referral', 'Ashley', 'Adams', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'milaaudet@icloud.com', NULL, '720-333-6592', NULL, NULL, '1984-04-10', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2016-09-21 17:23:45', '2025-08-08 14:51:53', 'Ashley Adams', '564 S. Pearl St.', 'Denver', 'CO', '80209', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I found out that oxycontin is a controlled substance and most of the methods used with your membership will not provide oxycontin.  But, I found Oxycodone ER is listed as the generic version of oxycontin.  You can currently get this for $77 for 10 mg and 60 tablets. These prices are liable to change slightly. You can always double check with your doctor to see if there''s any other generic version or any other options for this as well. 9-21-16 UPDATE- Wendy,
I still plan on doing the health share. At this point my fibromyalgia is pretty manageable. I only made like $360 last month and I''m not going to make much more this month. The training process in this job and all the certification and stuff has been taking a long time. I should be getting more hours and building my client base within the next few months and then I will need to get insurance. I just wanted to let you know where I''m at.
Thanks,
Ashley', 'Liberty HealthShare', 'Wellfit Newsletter May-Sent

