  ('zcrm_1579374000001165403', NULL, 'Future Prospect', 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Seminar-Internal', 'Kathryn', 'Brantmeyer', 'zcrm_1579374000000157741', 'Wendy Scipione', 'realestate@brantmeyer.com', NULL, '720-530-0055', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'zcrm_1579374000000088015', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-12-08 23:37:08', '2025-08-08 14:51:47', 'Kathryn Brantmeyer', NULL, NULL, 'CO', NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:47', NULL, 'Rick- Using VA', NULL, 'Female 16', NULL, 'Female 16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Super nice and plans to call with more questions. Daughter plays softball around country so pleased that can see any doc at any time.  She is NOT comfortable with LHS. Tried to call them a few times to answer questions and nobody ever answered. She watched about 3 hours of videos including a radio talk show with a female doctor interviewing Dale Bellis. She thought he was a smooth talker and never answered the questions. So, turned off by all of that. Now is in the hellish black hole of Medicaid denial process. Supposedly waiting behind 9000 folks to get determination. Rick will call me tomorrow 12-22-15 to let me know that status of what''s going on. They may use me as their agent to get through the process. At wits end to get insurance coverage. Sounds like might choose Cigna.  I bet they may be stuck in system bc of his VA coverage perhaps!?!?', 'To Be Determined', NULL, '0', '0.0', 'Health Insurance', NULL, '2016-01-01', 'BARA Member Referral', NULL, NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Female', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Converted', NULL, 'false', 'fa