  ('zcrm_1579374000000382653', 'Joan Phelps', 'Cancelled', 'zcrm_1579374000000237313', 'Joan Phelps', 'Seminar', 'Katherine Marie', 'Curtis', 'zcrm_1579374000010489003', 'Joan Phelps', 'katiemecurtis@gmail.com', NULL, '571 274 5157', NULL, '571-274-5157', '1984-05-01', 'zcrm_1579374000000084003', 'Rod Maxson', 'zcrm_1579374000000086007', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2015-08-30 09:55:31', '2025-08-08 14:51:45', 'Katherine Marie Curtis', '219 South L Street', 'Lake Worth', 'FL', '33460', FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1.0, '2025-08-08 14:51:45', NULL, 'Trevor Curtis', '11/10/1983', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<b>8/10/2015 03:25 PM</b>: 8.10.15: Sent Katie T/Y note w/$100 gift card.<hr /><b>8/7/2015 09:14 AM</b>: 7.31.15: Katie said she needs an OB/GYN. Refered her to Complete Healthcare for Women in Wellington (Kelly Alseleben''s group).<hr /><b>7/31/2015 04:26 PM</b>: Called and spoke to Katie. Told her she has to call LHS directly and make the acct. change.  She mentioned the $100 referral fee LHS is supposed to offer but she never got anything.<hr /><b>7/31/2015 04:25 PM</b>: 7.30.15: Didn''t hear back from Katie so sent her another email. She repsonded to this one and said she wants to add her husband for Aug. 1st.  She also gave me the name of a Naturopath she told about HES and suggsted he join as an Accepting Provider.<hr /><b>7/31/2015 04:24 PM</b>: 7.21.15: Emailed Katie. Told her to wait until the new HES/LHS programs are introduced and aslo to work with the new Wellfit platform before she makes any changes.  Also asked if she wants to add her husband to her acct. for Aug. 1st.<hr /><b>7/31/2015 04:22 PM</b>: 7.8.15 & 7.13.15: Katie emailed me to tell me she wants to add her husband to her membership. She also asked if she could change her HES membership to LHS because she hasn''t used the other services and doesn''t think she will. Also, the HES site was more difficult to navigate than the LHS site.<hr /><b>7/31/2015 04:20 PM</b>: 3.6.15: Katie emailed me she wasn''t being billed by LHS because they didn''t have her updated c.c.  She went on the LHS site and changed her pmt. card.<hr /><b>2/23/2015 04:01 PM</b>: Sent email reminder for advanced HES webinar tonight.<hr /><b>2/19/2015 10:53 AM</b>: 2.12.15:  Recvd. email from Katie - she was approved. Sent WWG congrats email<hr><b>2/11/2015 09:31 AM</b>: LHS Application reflected $149 fee instead of $199 although Katie is 30?<hr><b>2/11/2015 09:28 AM</b>: Guided Katie through enrollment application today.<hr><b>2/10/2015 12:27 PM</b>: Katie emailed a quesiton to me re: tax deduction for health care and I answered her email.<hr><b>2/9/2015 11:37 AM</b>: Emailed Katie to confirm 2/11/14 to enroll.<hr><b>2/9/2015 10:51 AM</b>: Katie is filing separately from her husband.<hr><b>2/9/2015 10:50 AM</b>: Called Katie &amp; discussed HES program. She will talk w/her husband. Asked me to call her on 2/11 to enroll for herself - husband has co. ins.  If he added her she would have to pay $700/mo.<hr><b>2/7/2015 02:35 PM</b>: Called Katie. She is interested in HES.  Wants to discuss on Mon. am. 2/9.15. Emailed her from WWG member flyer.<hr><b>2/05/2015 09:26 AM</b>: <b>1/30/2015 10:19 AM</b>: JK - She thinks HES might be best option.  If they go with ins. tha have to file jointly.<hr><hr>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Health Sharing', 'Member Only', '2015-03-01', 'Seminar', NULL, 'HES - CANCELLED', 'false', 'false', '150', '15', NULL, '5', 'House Account', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H0678', '2016-04-24', '2016-05-04', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Realtor Association of the Palm Beaches', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Manual', NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL,