10.31.15:  Emailed Else 2 pg. flyer and link to website. Asked to schedule time to meet at her office.
11.04.15:  Else emailed me. Her office manager, Marie and she have questions about being A.P. Asked if I could visit them on 11.11 at 10 a.m.
