11.06.15: Emailed Else confirmation of meeting.
11.11.15:  Met w/Else & Marie. Else and her husband currently have Medishare but Else is interested in HES because Medishare does not have all the services HES does, has a higher monthly share fee and a $5000 unshared amount for a couple and does not include alternative med. txs.  Else needs to discuss it with her husband but would change to HES as of 1/1/16.  Marie is also interested in HES.  Wants to change as of 1/1/16. I suggested we enroll ASAP and set start date for 1/1/16.', 'Liberty HealthShare', NULL, '0', '0.0', 'Health Sharing', 'Member and Spouse', '2015-11-30', 'Ashley Ageloff''s Women''s Event', NULL, NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Converted', NULL, 'false', 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'false', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11, 'Contacts_2026_03_20.csv'),
