herwise!   UPDATE- will fill out form and email it back for me to become his agent.  Yes, he does need to include his SS income which he will begin withdrawing in 2016. We will talk again on Monday. Nov.  9th to finalize his choice.  Mike will call me Feb. 1st to update income when starts receiving SS payment.', 'Liberty HealthShare', 'Wellfit Newsletter April 2017 -Opened
